================================================================================
Third-Party Notices & Attributions
================================================================================

This repository bundles the runtime assemblies required by YKWModelTool. Each
third-party component retains its original copyright and license terms:

1. Metanoia (Metanoia\Metanoia.exe, Metanoia\lib\HSDLib.dll,
             Metanoia\lib\DivaAlchemy.dll)
   - Author / Project: ploaj (https://github.com/ploaj/Metanoia)
   - Note: Metanoia\Metanoia.exe includes a 1-method IL patch at file offset
     0xD0F fixing FormatManager.GetAnimationExtensionFilter() so animation files
     can be browsed reliably.

2. OpenTK (Metanoia\OpenTK.dll, Metanoia\OpenTK.GLControl.dll)
   - https://opentk.net/
   - Copyright (c) 2006 - 2016 Stefanos Apostolopoulos <stapostol@gmail.com>
     for the Open Toolkit library.

3. Newtonsoft.Json / Json.NET (Metanoia\Newtonsoft.Json.dll)
   - Copyright (c) James Newton-King 2008

4. DockPanel Suite (Metanoia\WeifenLuo.WinFormsUI.Docking.dll)
   - Copyright (c) Weifen Luo and other contributors 2007-2018

External tools (not bundled in this repository):
- Blender (https://www.blender.org/) — Used externally at runtime to assemble
  GLB, FBX, and .blend files from exported COLLADA models and animations.
- Kuriimu2 (https://github.com/FanTranslatorsInternational/Kuriimu2) — Used
  for XPCK (.xc/.xv) archive inspection and format verification.
